SEARCH A 2D MATRIX

(NOT in your list)

🔹 Algorithm

Treat matrix as a sorted 1D array and use Binary Search.

🔹 Java Code
class Search2DMatrix {
    public boolean searchMatrix(int[][] matrix, int target) {
        int m = matrix.length;
        int n = matrix[0].length;

        int low = 0, high = m * n - 1;

        while (low <= high) {
            int mid = (low + high) / 2;
            int value = matrix[mid / n][mid % n];

            if (value == target) return true;
            else if (value < target) low = mid + 1;
            else high = mid - 1;
        }
        return false;
    }
}

🔹 Input
matrix = [[1,3,5],[7,9,11]]
target = 9

🔹 Output
true
